{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226700","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226700","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422670001:1":{"text":"みなさんが来る前に……ターラン川が……水の流れが、鹿霊の導きを教えてくれました。","source_cn":"在你们到来之前……塔兰河……已经用它的水流……向我传达...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4248D2B1E7412B74","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422670002:1":{"text":"つ、追放された民は……彼方より来たるその身を……川に浸し――","source_cn":"被、被驱逐的子民……需要将远行的躯体……浸入河川当中。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5CF5761725BAD5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422670003:1":{"text":"体を清めれば……絶たれたつながりは……再び、水脈と結ばれる、と。","source_cn":"洁净身躯……将已然断绝的联系……与水脉重新接续。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7899EC27A36E2689","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1422670003":{"text":"体を清めれば……絶たれたつながりは……再び、水脈と結ばれる、と。","source_cn":"洁净身躯……将已然断绝的联系……与水脉重新接续。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7899EC27A36E2689","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422670004:1":{"text":"ターラン川は……慈悲深い川ですから……優しく、支えてくれるはずです……","source_cn":"塔兰河……很仁慈……会温柔地托举他的身躯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72F16B25BFB73221","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1422670005:1":{"text":"けれど、もし拒絶されたら、その時は……","source_cn":"但，如果被拒绝，可能也……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB669BBED9652ACC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1422670006:1":{"text":"あっ、け、けど！その時は、わたしが……なんとかしますので……！","source_cn":"不、不过那时……我会想办法！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD30F98B2ABA086C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1422670008:1":{"text":"水に触れると……きっと、痛みが体を襲います……","source_cn":"浸入到河流中……会感到痛苦……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31A43DB6B29D8F93","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1422670009:1":{"text":"つながりを再び結ぶというのは……切れた体を、もう一度くっつけるようなもの……","source_cn":"重现连接……就像……就像将断掉的肢体重续……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA19B5BB0A1C41D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1422670010:1":{"text":"だから……水がもたらす苦痛に耐え……同時に、心を開く必要があるのです……","source_cn":"必须……要承受住河水带来的痛楚……同时……敞开心扉……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C0ECD59220FEF2A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1422670011:1":{"text":"どれほど辛くとも、私は受け入れる。","source_cn":"不论有多痛苦，我都会接受。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFFC967D3B62EAF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1422670012:1":{"text":"あ、あと……川は、あなたの心を、視ます。決して、隠し事はしないでください……","source_cn":"还有一点……河流……会检验你的内心。不、不要瞒着它……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD48194F8D6840AF6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1422670013:1":{"text":"これはミサタ様の試練。当時、神の御意志に背いた代償を本当に理解したのか、確かめたいのでしょう。","source_cn":"这是弥萨忒的考验。祂要确认你是否理解了当初违背神意的后果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x27DA3D04FDFA865B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1422670014:1":{"text":"先祖の選択が間違っていたとは思わない。だが、一族の責任は私が背負う。必ずや、己の決意と誠意を神に示してみせよう。","source_cn":"我并不认为祖先们的选择有错，但我愿意为族人承担责任。我...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x804F99AAB29C3FC8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1422670015:1":{"text":"怖がらないで、ください……痛いかもしれませんが……ターラン川は、あなたを傷つけません……わたしも、そばにいますから……","source_cn":"不要……害怕……虽然痛苦……但塔兰河不会伤害……我会…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97D35C543A92F0BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1422670016:1":{"text":"準備はできている。始めよう。","source_cn":"我准备好了，开始吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE2512C815E779251","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"インドラ、君泳げるのか？","source_cn":"因度厄会游泳吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAC1E50A67FA78A76","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"インドラ、君泳げるのか？","female":"インドラ、あなた泳げるの？","variant_male_record_index":"72994","variant_female_record_index":"72995","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1422670007:1":{"text":"は、はい……ですが、川に身を浸すだけでは……試練にはなりません。","source_cn":"是、是的……如果只是泡在河里……是无法构成考验的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA473A175C9C07BDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:1:2":{"text":"それだけでいいのか？","source_cn":"那么简单吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x798340ECB2D76901","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_differs","male":"それだけでいいのか？","female":"それだけでいいの？","variant_male_record_index":"72996","variant_female_record_index":"72997","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊温":{"text":"イヴォンヌ","source":"伊温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:因度厄":{"text":"インドラ","source":"因度厄","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:埃隆":{"text":"エルロン","source":"埃隆","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":20,"localized_text_count":19,"speaker_count":3}}